1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,200
Your bot just saw hundreds of signals.

2
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:06,800
Every one meets the same gates.

3
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:11,000
Signal. Filter. Risk gate. Execute.

4
00:00:11,100 --> 00:00:18,800
Most die at the filter.
Half of the rest, at risk.

5
00:00:18,900 --> 00:00:20,900
Rejected is the bot doing its job.

6
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:24,800
Now switch the risk gate off.

7
00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:27,400
More trades. Bigger size. Drawdown.

8
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:31,000
Gate back on.
The edge is what it refuses.
